.TH "INSPEKT\-INSTANCES" "1" "2026\-04\-16" "Inspekt 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
inspekt\-instances \- List and manage connected browser instances.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\f[B]inspekt\f[R] \f[B]instances\f[R] [\f[I]OPTIONS\f[R]]
\f[I]SUBCOMMAND\f[R] [\f[I]ARGS\f[R]]\&...
.SH DESCRIPTION
List and manage connected browser instances.
.PP
Shows all connected browsers with their unique IDs, aliases, and status.
Use the \(eninstance/\-i global flag to target a specific instance.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\f[B]\(enjson\f[R]
Output as JSON
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
\f[B]alias\f[R]
Set a temporary alias for a browser instance.
.TP
\f[B]identify\f[R]
Flash/highlight a browser instance to identify it visually.
.TP
\f[B]unalias\f[R]
Remove an alias from a browser instance.
.SH EXAMPLES
.IP
.EX
inspekt instances
inspekt instances \-\-json
inspekt instances alias b7x2 home
inspekt instances unalias home
inspekt instances identify b7x2
.EE
